      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant mechanical response can be assessed by tensile testing at room or ambient temperature.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stepwise controllable precipitation can create a heterogeneous microstructure containing multiple coherent nanoprecipitates.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "γ″ particles pin dislocations.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent δ/γ interfaces permit dislocation transmission or shearing across the δ-lamellae.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation pinning by precipitates increases strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slip transmission across coherent interfaces relieves local stress concentrations and suppresses premature crack initiation.",
